 requests may disturb you! This time I hope to request you with drawing another paro for OCs (Blanke and Side). \nReference link:https://sta.sh/22cum2aqg2kz\n\n○Characters\nBlanke(190cm): The young master of a large family. He is currently on the run and planning revenge due to family internal power struggles. Always expressionless and wearing sunglasses outside. He would get angry due to trivial matters and lack patience.\nSide(158cm): The abandoned android. His damaged body is found and repaired by Blanke, but due to the virus, there are occasional symptoms of mental confusion and amnesia. Will execute Blanke's commands very mechanically, and his stubborn behavior occasionally troubles. Usually, he has a serious expression. \n\n○Request \nPlease draw illustration according to their setting. \nRegarding the clothing design in the reference, if there are any parts that you cannot understand, you can modify them yourself.\n\nThank you so much for considering!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@mo_otsss/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3915570, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/72640e0a/uploads/origins/0ea5d21f-c101-4091-a386-2bb014fcea55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03c192936b58631187634b38f4e4cf1c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/72640e0a/uploads/origins/0ea5d21f-c101-4091-a386-2bb014fcea55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03c192936b58631187634b38f4e4cf1c, https://si.imgix.net/72640e0a/uploads/origins/0ea5d21f-c101-4091-a386-2bb014fcea55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4dc88731a09f9894e6f8c2d7ac61386d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/72640e0a/uploads/origins/0ea5d21f-c101-4091-a386-2bb014fcea55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w